Z||000005||FieroHeather||06-29-2001||12:21 AM||||Uhh... no comment.  Cause if I did, I could quite possibly be calling the kettle black.  So Im not.<P>I know that some of the nicest guys have melted my heart--but unfortunately for them, I have been hooked up with someone I have loved for years.  I am faithful, and if I cheat on my bf once, it will ultimately happen again.  Doesnt the saying go: Once a cheater, always a cheater?<P>But that saying in itself has had to make me deal with issues of forgiveness, of grace, and of trust over the past couple of years or so.||||reg||1
